Reference is **ReviewLens AI**, a review ingestion and grounded Q&A application. All flows remain on `/`.

Visual system: white background, forest-green accent, subtle pale-lime hero glow and 56px grid, Geist sans, Instrument Serif italic hero line, Geist Mono metadata. Header/content max width 1152px with 24px padding; hero/form max width 768px. Ingestion card uses URL/Paste/CSV tabs, sample-data link, rounded borders, and soft green shadow.

After ingest: two-column summary and chat, approximately 380px/700px with 24px gap. Summary contains source, New button, readiness badge, three stats, rating bars, completeness/date details, warnings, and review accordion. Chat has suggested question pills, grounded answers, citations, and bottom message composer. Mobile stacks columns.

Exact tokens:

```css
--primary: oklch(42% .11 160);
--foreground: oklch(18% .01 160);
--muted: oklch(97.5% .004 150);
--muted-foreground: oklch(50% .015 160);
--accent: oklch(95% .06 140);
--border: oklch(92% .006 150);
box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px oklch(18% .01 160/.06),
            0 24px 60px -28px oklch(42% .11 160/.35);
```

